sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant You
  participant CC as Claude Code
  participant H as vibesenpai hooks
  participant W as detached jobs
  participant M as the model

  CC->>H: SessionStart
  H-->>You: last pass's summary (systemMessage)
  H->>W: standing pass, if stale
  W-->>W: parse + the free checks (local)

  You->>CC: a turn
  CC->>H: Stop
  H->>W: standing pass, if stale
  H->>W: judge, if due and within limits
  Note right of H: the hook exits here
  W->>M: redacted packet (asserted)
  M-->>W: episodes, then labels
  W-->>W: findings stored

  You->>CC: /vibesenpai:insights
  CC-->>You: what the passes stored (sends nothing)
